---
---

<section class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden bg-[#FAF9F6] text-[#1a1a1a]">
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <p class="text-[#1a1a1a]/70 font-sans text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-[0.26em] uppercase mb-3">
        Got Questions?
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.06em] text-[#1a1a1a]">
        Frequently asked questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-0">
      <div class="faq-item border-b border-[#1a1a1a]/15 transition-all duration-300">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-6 md:py-7 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-sans font-bold text-lg md:text-2xl text-[#1a1a1a] group-hover:text-[#1a1a1a]">1. What does your service include as a full creative agency?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-base md:text-lg text-[#1a1a1a]/60 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-sans text-[#1a1a1a]/75 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed pb-6 md:pb-8 max-w-4xl">
              Helm began as a web design and development studio. As more clients asked us for other creative work, we expanded into a full creative agency. Our services include branding, with research, strategy, positioning, logo design, and company profiles. We also provide digital marketing, film production, sound design, sound engineering, and other creative services your project may need.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border-b border-[#1a1a1a]/15 transition-all duration-300">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-6 md:py-7 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-sans font-bold text-lg md:text-2xl text-[#1a1a1a]">2. How much does a website cost?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-base md:text-lg text-[#1a1a1a]/60 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-sans text-[#1a1a1a]/75 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed pb-6 md:pb-8 max-w-4xl">
              The cost of a custom website depends on its size, features, content, and integrations. A simple business website costs less than a complex platform with custom tools or a marketplace. Tell us what you need and we will prepare a clear estimate. You can also use our <a href="/calculator" class="text-[#1a1a1a] underline underline-offset-4">Project Calculator</a> for a quick starting estimate.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border-b border-[#1a1a1a]/15 transition-all duration-300">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-6 md:py-7 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-sans font-bold text-lg md:text-2xl text-[#1a1a1a]">3. What is your process for a new creative project?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-base md:text-lg text-[#1a1a1a]/60 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-sans text-[#1a1a1a]/75 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed pb-6 md:pb-8 max-w-4xl">
              We begin by learning about your goals, audience, and business. Then we research, develop a clear direction, and create the design or content. After your feedback, we refine the work and prepare the final files or build. The timeline depends on the size and type of the project.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border-b border-[#1a1a1a]/15 transition-all duration-300">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-6 md:py-7 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-sans font-bold text-lg md:text-2xl text-[#1a1a1a]">4. Can you handle a project that needs more than one creative service?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-base md:text-lg text-[#1a1a1a]/60 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-sans text-[#1a1a1a]/75 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed pb-6 md:pb-8 max-w-4xl">
              Yes. We can combine strategy, branding, web development, digital marketing, photography, film, sound, and other creative services in one project. This keeps the work consistent and gives you one team to manage the full creative direction.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border-b border-[#1a1a1a]/15 transition-all duration-300">
        <button class="faq-toggle w-full flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-6 md:py-7 text-left focus:outline-none group">
          <span class="font-sans font-bold text-lg md:text-2xl text-[#1a1a1a]">5. What do you need from me before we begin?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-base md:text-lg text-[#1a1a1a]/60 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-out">
          <div class="overflow-hidden">
            <p class="font-sans text-[#1a1a1a]/75 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed pb-6 md:pb-8 max-w-4xl">
              Start with your idea, your goals, and any information you already have about your business. Existing logos, photos, text, and brand files are helpful, but they are not required. We can build the strategy and creative direction with you from the beginning.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item');

    faqItems.forEach((item) => {
      const toggle = item.querySelector('.faq-toggle');
      const content = item.querySelector('.faq-content') as HTMLElement | null;
      const icon = item.querySelector('.fa-chevron-down') as HTMLElement | null;

      toggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const isOpen = content?.style.gridTemplateRows === '1fr';

        faqItems.forEach((faq) => {
          const currentContent = faq.querySelector('.faq-content') as HTMLElement | null;
          const currentIcon = faq.querySelector('.fa-chevron-down') as HTMLElement | null;
          if (currentContent) currentContent.style.gridTemplateRows = '0fr';
          if (currentIcon) currentIcon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
        });

        if (!isOpen && content) {
          content.style.gridTemplateRows = '1fr';
          if (icon) icon.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';
        }
      });
    });
  </script>
</section>